mdspan
------------------------------------------
Reference implementation of mdspan targeting C++23

Runtime requirements:

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/kokkos/mdspan

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/kokkos/mdspan/archive/refs/tags/5.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mdspan-5.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mdspan-5.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mdspan-5.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mdspan-5.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

